  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet ing&#xe5;r i ledningsutvecklingsprogrammet &quot;Mongolian  Management Development program&quot;, vilket initierats av mongoliska regerringen i samarbete med UNDP.  Assistera kabinettet med att forma en demokratisk samh&#xe4;llsutveckling.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is a part of the management program &quot;Mongolian Management Development Program&quot;, initiated by the Mongolian  government in cooperation with UNDP.  To assist the Cabinet Secretariat to develop a democratic development in Mongolia</narrative>
